{"sectionId":"cell/cytoskeleton","items":[{"id":"cell--cytoskeleton-k001","sectionId":"cell/cytoskeleton","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"액틴 미세섬유는 세포 운동, 미세융모, 수축환, 근수축에 관여하며 미오신은 액틴 기반 운동단백질이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cytoskeleton-k002","sectionId":"cell/cytoskeleton","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"미세소관은 α/β 튜불린으로 이루어지고 방추사, 섬모·편모 및 세포 내 수송의 궤도이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cytoskeleton-k003","sectionId":"cell/cytoskeleton","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"일반적인 키네신은 +말단 방향, 세포질 디네인은 -말단 방향으로 이동한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cytoskeleton-k004","sectionId":"cell/cytoskeleton","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"중간섬유는 케라틴, 비멘틴, 라민 등으로 기계적 안정성을 제공한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cytoskeleton-k005","sectionId":"cell/cytoskeleton","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"운동성 섬모는 일반적으로 9+2 축사 구조를 갖고 디네인이 굽힘 운동을 일으킨다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cytoskeleton-k006","sectionId":"cell/cytoskeleton","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"밀착연접은 세포 사이 장벽을 형성하고, 부착연접은 카데린과 액틴을 연결한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cytoskeleton-k007","sectionId":"cell/cytoskeleton","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"데스모좀은 카데린과 중간섬유를, 헤미데스모좀은 인테그린과 중간섬유를 통해 세포를 기저막에 고정한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cytoskeleton-k008","sectionId":"cell/cytoskeleton","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"간극연접의 코넥손은 작은 분자와 이온의 세포 간 이동을 허용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cytoskeleton-k009","sectionId":"cell/cytoskeleton","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"상피는 단층편평(폐포·혈관), 단층입방(신장 세뇨관 일부), 단층원주(장), 중층편평(피부·식도), 거짓중층(기도), 이행상피(방광)","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cytoskeleton-k010","sectionId":"cell/cytoskeleton","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"등으로 구분한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cytoskeleton-k011","sectionId":"cell/cytoskeleton","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"결합·근육·신경조직도 기본 조직 유형이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cytoskeleton-k012","sectionId":"cell/cytoskeleton","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"미세융모는 액틴, 섬모는 미세소관.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cytoskeleton-k013","sectionId":"cell/cytoskeleton","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"콜히친은 미세소관 중합을 방해하고 파클리탁셀은 안정화하여 정상 동역학을 억제한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cytoskeleton-k014","sectionId":"cell/cytoskeleton","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"헤미데스모좀은 중간섬유 연결이며 초점접착은 액틴 연결이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cytoskeleton-k015","sectionId":"cell/cytoskeleton","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"간극연접이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}